### Banking Transactions API — sample requests
### Use with the VS Code "REST Client" extension. Server must be running on :3000.
@base = http://localhost:3000

### Create a transfer
POST {{base}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "toAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": 100.50,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "transfer"
}

### Create a deposit
POST {{base}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "amount": 500,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "type": "deposit"
}

### Validation error (negative amount, bad currency, bad account) -> 400
POST {{base}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "XX-1",
  "toAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": -5,
  "currency": "XYZ",
  "type": "transfer"
}

### List all transactions
GET {{base}}/transactions

### Filter by account
GET {{base}}/transactions?accountId=ACC-12345

### Filter by type
GET {{base}}/transactions?type=transfer

### Filter by date range
GET {{base}}/transactions?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31

### Get one transaction by id (replace the id)
GET {{base}}/transactions/REPLACE-WITH-ID

### Account balance
GET {{base}}/accounts/ACC-12345/balance

### Account summary (bonus)
GET {{base}}/accounts/ACC-12345/summary

### CSV export (bonus)
GET {{base}}/transactions/export?format=csv
